WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.878
Some tasks need more than a title: the
receipt for the expense report, a
category, a

00:00:04.928 --> 00:00:06.944
reminder that comes back every month.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:12.914
Click a task, or select it and press
Enter, to open its details.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:18.277
Under Files you find its attachments.

00:00:18.577 --> 00:00:21.619
Drag files from Dolphin onto this area, or
choose Add file.

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:28.428
Open shows a file in its application.

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:30.818
Save as stores a copy wherever you like.

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:37.254
Categories group related tasks.

00:00:37.554 --> 00:00:40.120
Type a name and press Enter, or pick one
you used before.

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:48.694
Under Repeat, choose daily, weekdays,
weekly, monthly or yearly.

00:00:48.994 --> 00:00:52.604
Custom allows rules like every two weeks
on Monday and Thursday.

00:00:57.350 --> 00:00:59.486
Switch on the reminder and pick a date and
time.

00:00:59.786 --> 00:01:02.480
The notification has a button to mark the
task as done.

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:10.891
Everything is synchronised with Microsoft
To Do, on your phone and on the web.

00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:17.276
And the search field finds tasks by their
category, too.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:23.579
That is how you organise tasks with
Merkzettel.

